      "note": "Statement of Activities business-type Charges for Services 12,254,095 and expenses 10,998,645 (p3) vs proprietary statement total operating revenues 12,254,097 and total operating expenses 10,998,647 (p11); both print operating income 1,255,450 (rounding in the report)."
